          "Check relative pronouns too: *la città dove ci sono nato is wrong twice; it should be \"la città in cui sono nato\" or \"la città dove sono nato\". \"Dove\" already contains the place, so \"ci\" is redundant.",
          "Also check the sequence of tenses. After a past main verb, the subjunctive moves back: \"Pensavo che partissero\", not *pensavo che partano. And after \"se\" in a hypothesis, never use the conditional. These are the errors examiners notice first, because they show whether the system is fully acquired.",
